{"id": "EUVD-2026-103320", "enisaUuid": "53be68f3-c399-3339-900f-28bb11ab6e38", "description": "phpMyFAQ before 4.1.9 and 4.2.0-alpha before 4.2.0-beta contains an improper authorization vulnerability in attachment.php that fails to verify whether an attachment's parent FAQ is published or visible to the requester. Authenticated users with the dlattachment permission can request index.php?action=attachment&id=<ID> to download complete attachment files belonging to draft FAQs.", "datePublished": "2026-10-17T18:46:21", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T21:39:13", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/thorsten/phpMyFAQ/security/advisories/GHSA-h76j-35m7-3mwq", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/phpmyfaq-before-4.1.9-and-4.2.0-alpha-before-4.2.0-beta-draft-faq-attachment-disclosure-via-attachment-php"], "aliases": ["GHSA-qwjg-39wm-p2qc", "CVE-2026-111900"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "db9e47e3-1510-3943-ae63-a35545793f06", "product": {"name": "phpMyFAQ", "vendor": {"name": "thorsten"}}, "product_version": "4.2.0-alpha <4.2.0-beta"}, {"id": "e4c9c4be-7cf2-3274-bacd-f04e95868eb6", "product": {"name": "phpMyFAQ", "vendor": {"name": "thorsten"}}, "product_version": "0 <4.1.9"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c46d67fb-8e98-36ca-9475-e5c65db64a5d", "vendor": {"name": "thorsten"}}], "isExploited": false}